<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  DiscreteScroll at login. Symlinked to ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ by install.sh.

  ProgramArguments names the executable INSIDE the bundle, never `open -a`.
  open hands the launch to LaunchServices and exits immediately; launchd would
  read that exit as the job finishing and, with KeepAlive below, respawn it
  forever. Running the binary directly is fine here because DiscreteScroll is
  an LSUIElement: no dock tile, no menu bar, nothing needing LaunchServices.

  KeepAlive means launchd restarts the process whenever it stops, including
  when you quit it. To actually stop it, bootout the job. It also means
  bootstrapping this before /Applications/DiscreteScroll.app exists leaves
  launchd respawning into ENOENT on a throttle, so install the app first
  (macos/bootstrap.sh does both, in that order).

  Load it once, after the app is in place:
    launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.emreyolcu.DiscreteScroll.plist
  Not `launchctl load`: macOS answers that one with
  "Recommended alternatives: bootstrap | enable".
    launchctl print     gui/$(id -u)/com.emreyolcu.DiscreteScroll
    launchctl kickstart -k gui/$(id -u)/com.emreyolcu.DiscreteScroll
    launchctl bootout   gui/$(id -u)/com.emreyolcu.DiscreteScroll

  Unlike every other file this repo links, the symlink alone is NOT the whole
  deployment: launchd reads this plist once, at bootstrap, so editing it in the
  repo changes nothing until you bootout and bootstrap again.

  On macOS 13 and later the job also registers with Background Task Management,
  so you get a "Background Items Added" notification and an entry under System
  Settings > General > Login Items and Extensions. That toggle is a one time
  approval; while it is off, the job will not start at login whatever this file
  says. Accessibility must be granted separately, in Privacy and Security.

  Validate after editing:  plutil -lint <this file>
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>Label</key>
	<string>com.emreyolcu.DiscreteScroll</string>
	<key>ProgramArguments</key>
	<array>
		<string>/Applications/DiscreteScroll.app/Contents/MacOS/DiscreteScroll</string>
	</array>
	<key>RunAtLoad</key>
	<true/>
	<key>KeepAlive</key>
	<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
